# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
venv/
.venv/
env/

# Secrets / private key material -- generated locally per docs/03_add_tls.md
# and docs/07_transport_zero_trust.md, never committed. ca.key/server.key/
# coap_server.key are real TLS private keys; mosquitto_passwd holds hashed
# broker credentials. Public certs (*.crt) are excluded too since they're
# regenerated alongside the keys by the same scripts -- nothing here is
# meant to be shared via git, only generated fresh per deployment.
certs/*.key
certs/*.crt
certs/*.csr
certs/*.srl
certs/mosquitto_passwd
certs/mosquitto_acl

# Real HMAC secrets / MQTT broker passwords for this machine's local
# deployment -- see src/secrets_local.example.py for the committed
# template. config.py imports from this file if it exists, falling back
# to placeholder values otherwise.
src/secrets_local.py

# Runtime databases -- regenerate every run, not source
data/audit_log.db
src/data/audit_log.db
*.db

# Rotated audit archives (audit_log.py's rotation writes
# <name>.archived-<date>_rotate). These are NOT matched by the *.db rule
# above -- the suffix comes after the extension -- so they need their own
# rule or a 23MB rotated audit database lands in a commit. They are local
# tamper-evident runtime evidence tied to this machine's audit key, and
# the checkpoint archive is derived from data/audit_key.bin, which is
# itself never committed: publishing either is both useless to a cloner
# and a needless disclosure of this deployment's decision history.
*.archived-*

# gateway.py's own boot_id counter (decision-channel anti-replay,
# RESULTS.md Section 14 item 3) -- same treatment as firmware/main.py's
# boot_id.txt on the device side: local runtime state, not source.
src/data/gateway_boot_id.txt

# Audit-log checkpoint HMAC key (audit_log.py) -- same category as the TLS
# private keys above: real secret key material generated locally, never
# committed. checkpoint_log.jsonl is derived from it (HMACs computed with
# this key) and is local runtime state tied to this specific key instance,
# not source -- excluded alongside it for the same reason.
data/audit_key.bin
data/checkpoint_log.jsonl

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
